&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Anthropic is an AI safety and research company that works to build reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our customers and for society as a whole. Our interdisciplinary team has experience across ML, physics, policy, business, and product.&lt;/p&gt;
