&lt;li&gt;Develop hypotheses on product changes, design controlled experiments, analyze the results, and make recommendations based on findings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams to understand customer behavior, identify growth opportunities, and drive data-informed decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build sophisticated models to segment users by use case, behavior patterns, and value to inform targeted product development and go-to-market strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish foundational data practices and help scale our analytics infrastructure to support rapid iteration and decision-making as our products grow&lt;/li&gt;
