&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 5+ years of experience in data science or analytics roles with significant focus on product analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 3+ years of experience working closely with Product or Engineering teams, with demonstrated impact on product roadmap and strategy&lt;/li&gt;
