&lt;li&gt;Have a track record of translating complex data into clear, actionable insights for both technical and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a bias for action and ability to thrive in ambiguous, fast-moving environments where you must create clarity and drive forward progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a passion for the company’s mission of building helpful, honest, and harmless AI&lt;/li&gt;
