&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep understanding of Indian enterprises&lt;/strong&gt; including decision-making processes, budget cycles, and stakeholder dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience selling transformational technology&lt;/strong&gt; (Cloud, AI/ML, Digital Transformation platforms) to Indian enterprises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Established relationships&lt;/strong&gt; with senior executives across multiple industry verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry and Market Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
