&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A passion for and/or experience with advanced AI systems. You feel strongly about ensuring frontier AI systems are developed safely&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Strong candidates may have:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience selling emerging technologies (AI/ML, cloud platforms, or data analytics) to Japanese enterprises&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established relationships with senior executives at major Japanese corporations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience navigating Japanese procurement processes and working with system integrators&lt;/p&gt;
