&lt;li&gt;Are skilled in data visualization and reporting tools (HEX, Looker, Power BI, Tableau, or similar platforms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show enthusiasm for process improvement and innovation, with experience identifying and implementing operational enhancement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are passionate about leveraging technology to drive financial insight and strategic decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic environment and enjoy solving complex technical and business challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a strong attention to detail and commitment to data accuracy and system reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are excited about the opportunity to build and optimize financial systems that support cutting-edge AI research and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Care about ensuring that transformative AI systems are developed safely and responsibly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
