&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Developing automated environment quality pipelines that validate correctness and difficulty calibration before deployment to production training&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building internal tools for browsing and analyzing training run results, environment statistics, and data collection progress&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
