&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Develop comprehensive partner lifecycle management processes covering recruitment, onboarding, enablement, growth, and optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Create scalable frameworks for partner engagement that maintain quality as we expand our partner ecosystem globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Establish program governance, including partner agreements, engagement models, and escalation paths&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enablement and Partner Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 pl-7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Build and manage partner enablement programs including training curricula, certification pathways, and technical resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Develop enablement materials that help partners understand Claude&#39;s capabilities, competitive differentiation, and enterprise applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Create resources that enable partners to design, build, and deliver production-grade AI solutions for their clients&lt;/li&gt;
