&lt;p&gt;Own the programmatic elements of Sales and Partnerships recruiting globally, partnering with recruiting managers in EMEA and APAC to ensure consistency while allowing for regional flexibility&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and implement end-to-end recruiting processes that are rigorous, measurable, and built for scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop headcount forecasting models that tie directly to our revenue plan, enabling predictable hiring aligned to business growth&lt;/p&gt;
