&lt;p&gt;Lead with low ego and high EQ, building trust across functions and coaching your team through feedback and development rather than directive management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have operated in high-growth environments and know how to build processes that scale without becoming bureaucratic&lt;/p&gt;
