&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to build efficient, repeatable processes that scale with volume&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication and leadership skills with ability to motivate and develop talent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in API-first, consumption-based, or usage-based business models preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent work experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience at companies with PLG (product-led growth) or developer-focused go-to-market motions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience selling an API product&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
