&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are skilled at stakeholder management across government, industry, academia, and civil society, with a track record of building productive relationships with regulators and policymakers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have proven ability to drive cross-functional initiatives and influence decisions across legal, product, and research organizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are comfortable with ambiguity and can set strategic direction when frameworks don&#39;t yet exist&lt;/p&gt;
