&lt;p&gt;Experience educating policy audiences about AI/ML or other complex technical topics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of U.S. regulatory and compliance requirements for policy events and activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working in high-growth technology companies&lt;/p&gt;
