&lt;p&gt;Own the full lifecycle from discovery through deployment: scoping requirements with&amp;nbsp;recruiting users, building prototypes, gathering feedback, and iterating to production&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve integration issues, ensuring data flows correctly between&amp;nbsp;systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create documentation and lightweight enablement resources so the team can maintain&amp;nbsp;and extend your work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with internal engineering departments on shared infrastructure while owning&amp;nbsp;the &quot;middle layer&quot; of recruiting-specific automations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
