&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Troubleshoot complex revenue recognition scenarios, particularly those unique to consumption and usage-based pricing models&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive continuous improvement of revenue systems, identifying opportunities for automation and enhanced accuracy&lt;/p&gt;
