&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have hands-on experience with CPQ platforms (Salesforce CPQ, &lt;a class=&quot;text-accent-secondary-100 underline&quot; href=&quot;http://Nue.io&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Nue.io&lt;/a&gt;, DealHub, or similar) and their integration with billing and revenue systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
