&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain authorization artifacts including System Security Plans (SSPs), Security Assessment Reports (SARs), Plans of Action &amp;amp; Milestones (POA&amp;amp;Ms), and continuous monitoring documentation&lt;/li&gt;
