&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Commercial sales teams to align on priorities, goals, and engagement strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Orchestrate multi-channel campaigns—coordinating across digital, events, content, and partner channels to maximize reach and impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Build workshop and event formats from scratch, iterating based on performance data and attendee feedback&lt;/p&gt;
