&lt;li&gt;Query optimization for large datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with building stable and scalable services on cloud infrastructure and serverless architectures&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
