&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design sensibility or hands-on experience with UI/UX for AI-powered applications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with real-time applications, WebSocket implementations, or complex frontend interactions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re not looking for at this stage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep specialists who can&#39;t adapt if their domain becomes irrelevant&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engineers who&#39;ve only succeeded in big-company structures with well-defined processes and long timelines&lt;/p&gt;
