&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;People who are precious about their work or frame all past projects as successes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Those who need clear roadmaps and get stressed by shifting priorities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidates need not have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
