&lt;p&gt;Design, build, and maintain Windows-specific features and infrastructure for Claude Code&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the Windows developer experience, ensuring Claude Code installs, runs, and performs reliably across Windows environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and maintain PowerShell integrations and scripts that enable smooth Windows workflows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with the broader Claude Code team to ensure cross-platform compatibility and feature parity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with Windows package managers (Chocolatey, winget, scoop) to streamline installation and updates for Windows users&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Debug and resolve Windows-specific issues, including file system, permissions, and shell compatibility challenges&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engage directly with Windows developers inside and outside Anthropic to gather feedback and improve user experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to technical documentation to help Windows users get the most out of Claude Code&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You May Be a Good Fit If You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have deep Windows development experience, including PowerShell scripting and Windows system integration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have experience building and maintaining CLI applications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are passionate about developer tools and understand what makes tools useful and adoptable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Can work independently to identify and solve Windows-specific challenges&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have shipped software used by developers in production Windows environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Care about the societal impacts and ethics of your work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Candidates May Also Have Experience With&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have strong TypeScript development experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Linux and/or macOS development (cross-platform thinking)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
