&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 10+ years of relevant industry experience, 3+ years leading large scale, complex projects or teams as an engineer or tech lead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are obsessed with distributed systems at scale, infrastructure reliability, scalability, security, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in at least one programming language (e.g., Python, Rust, Go, Java)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and ability to work independently&lt;/li&gt;
