&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a data-driven approach, using metrics and insights to continuously improve content and self-service resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel at cross-functional collaboration, particularly with Product, Engineering, and Support teams&lt;/li&gt;
