&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build program structure for emerging enterprise requirements&lt;/strong&gt; — Create program charters, establish roles and timelines, develop communication strategies, and define success metrics for nascent initiatives identified through customer feedback or competitive analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
