&lt;li&gt;Establish and enforce clear criteria for eval inclusion: scores on historical models, state-of-the-art performance, and competitor comparisons&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate between research teams, marketing, and product to consolidate eval status into a single source of truth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a high bar: ensure reported statistics reflect model capabilities in an honest, accurate, and transparent way&lt;/li&gt;
