&lt;li&gt;Drive prioritization of eval tooling enhancements based on researcher needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify patterns across launches and drive systemic fixes rather than point solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with PMs and researchers to improve and implement high priority evals launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and prioritize the eval roadmap—working with cross-functional teams to identify which new evals are needed for upcoming launches and product requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement an operating model that reflects an evals environment with increasing complexity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process &amp;amp; Systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build lightweight but rigorous tracking systems—moving key information into structured formats that enable better decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
